&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Special_event_items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Special event items\">Special event items</a></b>, must own a Founder's Account - see tips\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Lesser_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Lesser False Life</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Lesser_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Lesser False Life</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer +5 maximum <a href=\"/page/Hit_point\" title=\"Hit point\">health</a>.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Founder%27s_Helm.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Founder%27s_Helm.png/420px-Founder%27s_Helm.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"222\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Founder%27s_Helm.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This helm commemorates the Founding of Stormreach, the day that the <a href=\"/page/Coin_Lords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Coin Lords\">Coin Lords</a> first allowed adventurers free run of the city.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>This helm is only available to characters whose account had a character in a guild of at least 10 people by the end of the Head Start Beta Event. It's a thank you to all of our preorder customers for participating in the Head Start Event.</li>\n<li>This item automatically spawns in the character inventory upon creation, and will spawn on all new characters made on this account.</li>\n<li>In addition to this helm, Founders were given two other bonuses:\n<ul><li>A special forum account title, and if desired - founder only forum avatar</li>\n<li>Their character's name from beta was written on the founders fountain added in the game in <a href=\"/page/Module_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Module 1\">Module 1</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817210811\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.109 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3201/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21640/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6230/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n138.75%  132.812     39 Template:IO\n100.00%   95.718      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   95.718      1 -total\n 97.14%   92.981      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 46.36%   44.370      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 45.52%   43.567      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 44.59%   42.685      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 43.62%   41.755      2 Template:InCategory\n 17.72%   16.961      1 Template:Mat\n 17.63%   16.875      3 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:14813-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817210811 and revision id 630990. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Clothing\n  | name                     = Founder's Helm\n  | slot                     = Head\n  | type                     = Helm\n  | durability               = 20\n  | material                 = Steel\n  | hardness                 = 31\n  | basevalue                = 5 pp\n  | weight                   = 0.10 lbs\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtC|BoA}}\n  | minlevel                 = 0\n  | quest                    = Special event items\n  | chest                    = must own a Founder's Account - see tips\n  | mythic                   = no\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{False Life|lesser}}\n  | description              = This helm commemorates the Founding of Stormreach, the day that the [[Coin Lords]] first allowed adventurers free run of the city.\n  | pic                      = Founder's Helm shown.png\n  | picdesc                  = Founder's Helm.png\n  | tips                     = \nThis helm is only available to characters whose account had a character in a guild of at least 10 people by the end of the Head Start Beta Event. It's a thank you to all of our preorder customers for participating in the Head Start Event.\n* This item automatically spawns in the character inventory upon creation, and will spawn on all new characters made on this account.\n* In addition to this helm, Founders were given two other bonuses:\n** A special forum account title, and if desired - founder only forum avatar\n** Their character's name from beta was written on the founders fountain added in the game in [[Module 1]].\n}}",
